{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55551","headline":"游南雁荡 · 薛正明","name":"游南雁荡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遐僻山深自晦明，峨峨千态画难成。\n半空高挂龙湫瀑，万仞宏开金石城。\n日射岚光轻锁黛，泉飞竹径细鸣筝。\n隐山无路停骖问，拂拂清风两腋生。\n（见周喟《南雁荡山志》卷七引郑思恭《崇祯南雁山志》。\n）（按：薛正明逸诗及小传，承张靖龙同志录示。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛正明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55551.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55551","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}